{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q412143","formula":"C₁₇H₁₂Cl₂N₄","hill":"C17H12Cl2N4","elements":["H","C","N","Cl"],"composition":{"C":17.0,"H":12.0,"N":4.0,"Cl":2.0},"names":{"en":"Triazolam","ru":"Триазолам","uk":"Тріазолам"},"descriptions":{"en":"Triazolam, sold under the brand name Halcion among others, is a central nervous system (CNS) depressant tranquilizer of the triazolobenzodiazepine (TBZD) class, which are benzodiazepine (BZD) derivatives. It possesses pharmacological properties similar to those of other benzodiazepines, but it is generally only used as a sedative to treat severe insomnia. In addition to the hypnotic properties, triazolam's amnesic, anxiolytic, sedative, anticonvulsant, and muscle relaxant properties are pronounced as well.","ru":"Триазолам — транквилизатор, угнетающий нервную систему. Относится к классу триазолобензодиазепинов, которые являются производными бензодиазепинов. Обладает фармакологическими свойствами, аналогичными таковым у других бензодиазепинов, но обычно используется только в качестве седативного средства для лечения тяжелой бессонницы."},"fame":30,"pubchemCid":5556,"mass":343.2,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC1=NN=C2N1C3=C(C=C(C=C3)Cl)C(=NC2)C4=CC=CC=C4Cl","inchikey":"JOFWLTCLBGQGBO-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"8-chloro-6-(2-chlorophenyl)-1-methyl-4H-[1,2,4]triazolo[4,3-a][1,4]benzodiazepine","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"5556","atoms":35,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-1.046,"y":4.601,"z":0.201,"el":"Cl"},{"x":-1.017,"y":-1.794,"z":-2.031,"el":"Cl"},{"x":2.214,"y":-0.352,"z":0.051,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.237,"y":-1.531,"z":1.437,"el":"N"},{"x":3.06,"y":-2.299,"z":0.643,"el":"N"},{"x":3.845,"y":-1.776,"z":-0.355,"el":"N"},{"x":1.382,"y":0.789,"z":0.024,"el":"C"},{"x":0.048,"y":0.746,"z":0.473,"el":"C"},{"x":2.105,"y":-1.431,"